": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}], "type": "RSLT", "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}]}, {"id": 11, "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "If only I had done things differently!", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn9le09ob02re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 1, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn9le09ob02re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn9le09ob02re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn9le09ob02re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "\u201cIt makes you money, doesn't it?\u201d \u201cNo? Then, it makes you happy, doesn't it?\u201d \u201cNo! Then why are you doing it?\u201d\n<br/>\nThat was my Uncle Adam's opinion on my previous position. I liked to say if there hadn't been a strike, I would have stayed, or if management hadn't hired scab employees, I wouldn't have left.", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn9le09ob02re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "Deep down though, I knew if they had paid me more, I'd still be there and I wouldn't have quit if I had loved the job even a tiny bit more. His philosophy on work boils down to two questions: Does it make you money, or, Does it make you happy? Which is fine, if you want to just pay your bills. But, to get my dream job, I need to dig a little deeper, don't I?  So, I came up with a couple of more questions to help me.<br/>\nThe first one is, \u201cWhat big problem is driving me crazy right now?\u201d Solving this problem is the secret to helping me understand what I was born to do. For example, the education system is obsolete and there is opportunity in online learning, isn't there?  This leads me to the next question which is: \u201cWhat companies are solving my problem?\u201d", "time": "23000"}, {"image": "engenn9le09ob02re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "If you had had something in common with that company then, it would have piqued your interest and your passion to work there. You now know a place that may hold your dream job. Now, you just need to find away to get your foot in the door and show them how eager you are to work there.", "time": "73000"}], "coverimg": "engenn9le09ob02re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}]}